</script>
<template>
  <section class="panel ticket-actions"><h2>当前可用动作</h2><p>版本 {{ ticket.rowVersion }} · 当前轮次 {{ ticket.roundId || '待核对' }}</p><p v-if="ticket.qualificationStatus === 'INVALID'" class="notice">{{ ticket.status === 'ASSIGNED' ? '指定候选已失效，仅授权客服可显式释放后重新分派。' : '当前负责人资格失效，保留历史责任并等待协调；不能继续记录或自动转派。' }}</p><p v-if="work.message.value" role="alert">{{ work.message.value }} {{ work.trace.value }}</p>
    <section v-if="cancelledDrafts.length" class="cancelled-drafts notice"><h3>已终止补充草稿的原附件仅可查询</h3><p>工单取消未丢弃本标签页原File、摘要和上传/回复UUID。仅核对原上传结果，不再上传、回复或自动清理；未引用文件由服务端既有维护规则处理。</p><SupplementFiles v-for="old in cancelledDrafts" :key="old.key" :draft="old" :ticket="ticket" read-only/></section>
    <section v-if="work.current.value" aria-label="原工单动作恢复"><h3>原操作结果待确认</h3><p>{{ actionLabels[work.current.value.action] }} · 原UUID {{ work.current.value.key }}</p><p>保留原目标、版本、轮次、分派和参数，不会自动重发。</p><section v-if="work.current.value.action === 'supplement-reply' && replyDraftByKey(work.current.value.key)"><p style="white-space:pre-wrap">原补充回复：{{ work.current.value.body.body }}</p><SupplementFiles :draft="replyDraftByKey(work.current.value.key)!" :ticket="ticket" read-only/></section><el-button :disabled="work.busy.value" @click="query">查询原动作结果</el-button><el-button v-if="missing" :disabled="work.busy.value || !canWrite || !permission(work.current.value.action) || !replayAllowed(work.current.value)" @click="send(work.current.value)">显式原UUID原参数重交</el-button></section>
    <template v-else><section v-if="work.archived.value.length" class="notice"><h3>{{ work.archived.value.some(p => p.action === 'supplement-reply') ? '旧方案或补充请求原操作仅可查询' : work.archived.value.some(p => p.action.startsWith('cancel-') || p.action.startsWith('transfer-')) || ticket.status === 'CANCELLED' ? '旧上下文原操作仅可查询' : '旧方案原操作仅可查询' }}</h3><p>工单已终结或当前上下文已变化，旧决定/回复/取消动作不再提交；原UUID、正文和附件仍保留在本标签页内存，不移作新方案或新问题。明确冲突后如重新回复，需要重新选择内容和附件，不挪用原文件。</p><article v-for="old in work.archived.value" :key="old.key"><el-button :disabled="work.busy.value" @click="lookupKey = old.key; lookup()">查询旧上下文原UUID {{ old.key }}</el-button><SupplementFiles v-if="old.action === 'supplement-reply' && replyDraftByKey(old.key)" :draft="replyDraftByKey(old.key)!" :ticket="ticket" read-only/></article></section><div class="actions"><el-button v-for="name in actions" :key="name" :disabled="work.busy.value || fileBusy || !canWrite" @click="choose(name)">{{ actionLabels[name] }}</el-button><p v-if="!actions.length">当前状态或权限下没有可用处理动作。</p></div>
      <form v-if="action" class="action-form" @submit.prevent="submit"><h3>{{ actionLabels[action] }}确认</h3><p>当前工单 {{ ticket.ticketNo }}，动作按此版本和轮次执行。</p><fieldset :disabled="work.busy.value" class="repair-fields">
        <template v-if="action.startsWith('reopen-')"><p>原轮次 {{ticket.roundId}} · 真实关闭操作 {{ticket.currentReopen?.sourceClosureOperationId||reopenCheck?.sourceClosureOperationId||ticket.closure?.operationId}} · 当前申请 {{ticket.currentReopen?.reopenRequestId||'无'}}</p><p>申请后仍为已关闭；只有主管批准才建新轮，审批和内部接单不算首次响应。</p><label>公开重开理由或审核说明<el-input v-model="form.reason" type="textarea" aria-label="公开重开理由"/></label><template v-if="action==='reopen-request'"><p v-if="reopenCheck">服务端当前 {{reopenCheck.serverNow}} · 关闭 {{reopenCheck.closedAt}} · 168小时截止 {{reopenCheck.reopenDeadline}} · {{reopenCheck.canRequest?'允许申请':'暂不允许'}} {{reopenCheck.blockers.join('、')}}</p><el-button @click="loadReopenCheck">核验服务端重开窗口</el-button><p>不同故障或超窗请另建关联报修并注明原单号 {{ticket.ticketNo}}；本页不自动创建新单。</p></template><template v-if="action==='reopen-approve'"><label><input v-model="form.sameFault" type="checkbox"/>已人工确认是同一故障</label><label>本轮确认等级<select v-model="form.priority" aria-label="重开确认等级"><option v-for="p in ['P1','P2','P3']" :key="p" :value="p">{{p}}</option></select></label><label><input v-model="form.specifyTarget" type="checkbox"/>明确指定本次合格候选</label><p v-if="!form.specifyTarget">明确不指定：批准后待分派，无负责人，授权客服可先实际回复；SLA从批准时起算。</p><p v-else>批准后仅待本人接单；旧负责人不默认继承，合格时可显式选择。</p></template><el-button @click="preview=signature;confirmed=false;form.acknowledged=false">预览重开决定</el-button><section v-if="preview===signature" class="notice"><p>源 {{ticket.roundId}} / {{ticket.closure?.operationId}} · 请求 {{ticket.currentReopen?.reopenRequestId||'新申请'}} · {{form.specifyTarget?'指定 '+form.engineerUserId:'不指定负责人'}}</p><p v-if="action==='reopen-approve'">人工确认同故障 {{form.sameFault?'是':'尚未确认'}} · 本轮等级 {{form.priority}}</p><p style="white-space:pre-wrap">{{form.reason}}</p><label><input v-model="confirmed" type="checkbox" @change="form.acknowledged=confirmed"/>确认本次关闭事实、同故障与公开决定；不自动重发</label></section></template>
        <template v-if="action==='round-response'"><label>客户可见人工接手回复<el-input v-model="form.body" type="textarea" aria-label="人工接手回复正文"/></label><p>发送实际回复才可能登记本轮首次响应，不表示已解决，不另计工时。</p><el-button @click="preview=signature;confirmed=false">预览人工接手回复</el-button><section v-if="preview===signature" class="notice"><p style="white-space:pre-wrap">{{form.body}}</p><label><input v-model="confirmed" type="checkbox"/>确认向客户公开本轮实际人工回复</label></section></template>
        <template v-if="action.startsWith('transfer-')"><p>源分派 {{ ticket.assignment?.assignmentId }} · 原负责人 {{ ticket.assignment?.engineerUserId }}。目标接受前原工程师继续负责；发起、拒绝、撤回和超时均不恢复旧主状态。</p><p v-if="ticket.currentTransfer">当前转派 {{ ticket.currentTransfer.transferRequestId }} · 目标 {{ ticket.currentTransfer.targetEngineerUserId }}</p><label>内部转派或撤回理由<el-input v-model="form.reason" type="textarea" aria-label="内部转派理由"/></label><el-button @click="preview = signature; confirmed = false">预览交接确认</el-button><section v-if="preview === signature" class="notice"><p>源 {{ticket.assignment?.engineerUserId}} / {{ticket.assignment?.assignmentId}} → 目标 {{action === 'transfer-request' ? form.engineerUserId : ticket.currentTransfer?.targetEngineerUserId}} / 部门 {{action === 'transfer-request' ? form.departmentId : ticket.currentTransfer?.targetDepartmentId}}</p><p style="white-space:pre-wrap">{{form.reason}}</p><label><input v-model="confirmed" type="checkbox"/>确认本次源目标与责任；目标接受前不交接、不授完整工单或附件权</label></section></template>
        <template v-if="action.startsWith('cancel-')"><p>工单 {{ ticket.ticketNo }} · 当前状态 {{ ticket.status }} · 当前申请 {{ ticket.currentCancellation?.cancelRequestId || '无' }}</p><p>{{ action === 'cancel-direct' ? '未受理直接取消成功后不可继续本轮处理；有补充首响不等于已受理。' : action === 'cancel-request' ? '仅提交取消申请；待审核期间工程师责任、处理和计时继续。' : action === 'cancel-approve' ? '仅普通维修本地适用检查通过才可批准并取消；不表示库存费用已清理。' : '拒绝只终结当前申请，工单保留服务端当前状态，不恢复申请时旧状态。' }}</p><label>{{ action === 'cancel-direct' ? '可选取消原因（1～500字符）' : '公开申请或审核理由（5～500字符）' }}<el-input v-model="form.reason" type="textarea" :rows="4" aria-label="取消公开理由"/></label><el-button @click="preview = signature; confirmed = false; form.acknowledged = false">预览取消决定</el-button><section v-if="preview === signature" class="notice"><p style="white-space:pre-wrap">{{ form.reason || '未填写可选取消原因' }}</p><label><input v-model="confirmed" type="checkbox" @change="form.acknowledged = confirmed"/>确认本次对象、公开理由与影响；不自动重发</label></section></template>
        <template v-if="action === 'supplement-reply' && draft"><p>当前问题：{{ ticket.currentSupplement?.question }}</p><label>补充回复正文<el-input v-model="form.body" type="textarea" :rows="5" aria-label="补充回复正文" :disabled="draft.frozen"/></label><p>仅原报修人在当前权限下回复；成功恢复{{ ticket.currentSupplement?.resumeState === 'PENDING_ACCEPTANCE' ? '待受理' : '处理中' }}，不表示受理或解决。</p><SupplementFiles :draft="draft" :ticket="ticket" @busy="fileBusy = $event"/></template>
        <template v-if="action === 'supplement-request'"><label>客户可见补充问题<el-input v-model="form.body" type="textarea" :rows="4" aria-label="客户可见补充问题"/></label><p>请求后等待原报修人回复；回复仅恢复请求前状态，不代表受理或解决。</p><el-button @click="preview = signature; confirmed = false">预览补充问题</el-button><section v-if="preview === signature" class="notice"><p style="white-space:pre-wrap">{{ form.body }}</p><label><input v-model="confirmed" type="checkbox"/>确认向客户公开本次补充问题</label></section></template>
        <template v-if="action === 'accept'"><label>故障类别<select v-model="form.categoryCode" aria-label="故障类别"><option value="">请选择</option><option v-for="(label,key) in categories" v-show="key !== 'UNCERTAIN'" :key="key" :value="key">{{ label }}</option></select></label><p>客户影响程度对应临时等级：{{ ticket.initialPriority || initialPriority[ticket.impact] }}，请人工确认最终等级。</p><label>最终优先级<select v-model="form.priority" aria-label="最终优先级"><option v-for="p in ['P1','P2','P3']" :key="p" :value="p">{{ p }}</option></select></label><label v-if="form.priority !== (ticket.initialPriority || initialPriority[ticket.impact])">调级原因<el-input v-model="form.priorityChangeReason" type="textarea" aria-label="调级原因"/></label><label>客户可见人工受理说明（必填）<el-input v-model="form.acceptanceMessage" type="textarea" aria-label="客户可见人工受理说明"/></label></template>
        <label v-if="action === 'reject' || action === 'release-invalid-assignment'">{{ action === 'reject' ? '客户可见驳回理由' : '释放理由' }}<el-input v-model="form.reason" type="textarea" :aria-label="action === 'reject' ? '客户可见驳回理由' : '释放理由'"/></label>
        <template v-if="action === 'assign' || action === 'transfer-request' || action==='reopen-approve' && form.specifyTarget"><label>授权处理部门<select v-model="form.departmentId" aria-label="授权处理部门"><option value="">请选择</option><option v-for="d in departments" :key="d.id" :value="d.id">{{ d.name }}</option></select></label><p v-if="!departments.length">当前没有可选的授权处理部门，请联系授权配置负责人。</p><label>候选姓名搜索<el-input v-model="keyword" aria-label="候选姓名搜索"/></label><el-button :disabled="!form.departmentId || work.busy.value" @click="loadCandidates()">查询合格候选</el-button><p v-if="candidateLoaded && !candidates.length">本次查询无合格工程师，请核对部门、能力及当前启用状态。</p><label>指定工程师<select v-model="form.engineerUserId" aria-label="指定工程师"><option value="">从查询结果选择</option><option v-for="c in candidates" :key="c.userId" :value="c.userId">{{ c.displayName }}</option></select></label><el-pagination v-if="candidateLoaded" :current-page="candidatePage" :total="candidateTotal" :page-size="20" layout="prev, pager, next, total" @current-change="loadCandidates"/><label v-if="action === 'assign'">分派说明（可选）<el-input v-model="form.note" type="textarea" aria-label="分派说明"/></label><p>{{action === 'transfer-request' ? '转派发起仅等待目标确认，原工程师继续负责；目标接受后已接单，无需再做普通接单。' : '分派成功仍待指定工程师本人接单，不表示开始处理。'}}</p></template>
        <p v-if="action === 'assignment-accept'">仅指定本人可接单；成功进入处理中，不表示维修完成。</p>
        <template v-if="action === 'solve'">
          <p>本次提交生成同轮新方案，等待原报修人确认；不是直接关闭工单。下列三段正文全部向客户公开。</p>
          <label>故障原因（客户可见）<el-input v-model="form.cause" type="textarea" :rows="3" aria-label="方案故障原因"/></label>
          <label>解决方式（客户可见）<el-input v-model="form.resolutionMethod" type="textarea" :rows="3" aria-label="方案解决方式"/></label>
          <label>客户说明<el-input v-model="form.customerMessage" type="textarea" :rows="3" aria-label="方案客户说明"/></label>
          <label>实际完成时间（本地时间）<input v-model="form.completedAt" type="datetime-local" step="1" aria-label="实际完成时间"/></label><p>提交时转换为UTC，由服务端核对本轮起点和接收时间；此时间不会提前停止解决计时。</p>
          <p>服务端本轮累计工时：<strong>{{ ticket.recordedWorkHours ?? '待核对' }}</strong> 小时（只读，可跨日超过24小时）</p><label><input v-model="form.hoursConfirmed" type="checkbox"/>确认本次累计工时；需修正时先返回追加真实处理记录</label>
          <fieldset><legend>可选证据：本工单原报修附件，最多5个</legend><label v-for="file in ticket.attachments.filter(f => f.state === 'READY')" :key="file.fileId"><input v-model="form.evidenceFileIds" type="checkbox" :value="file.fileId"/>{{ file.name }}</label><p v-if="!ticket.attachments.length">无原附件也可提交方案，本批不上传新的处理附件。</p></fieldset>
          <el-button @click="preview = signature; confirmed = false">预览客户可见方案</el-button><section v-if="preview === signature" class="notice solution-preview"><h4>客户将看到以下解决方案</h4><p style="white-space:pre-wrap">故障原因：{{ form.cause }}</p><p style="white-space:pre-wrap">解决方式：{{ form.resolutionMethod }}</p><p style="white-space:pre-wrap">客户说明：{{ form.customerMessage }}</p><p>实际完成时间（本地）：{{ form.completedAt }} · 确认累计工时：{{ ticket.recordedWorkHours }}小时</p><p>本次显式选择的已引用证据：{{ form.evidenceFileIds.length ? [...ticket.attachments,...historicalEvidence].filter(f => form.evidenceFileIds.includes(f.fileId)).map(f => f.name).join('、') : '无' }}</p><label><input v-model="confirmed" type="checkbox"/>确认将本方案全部内容向客户公开</label></section>
        <SolutionEvidencePicker :ticket="ticket" v-model="form.evidenceFileIds" @files="historicalEvidence=$event" @busy="fileBusy=$event"/></template>
        <template v-if="isCustomerDecision(action)"><p>只针对当前方案 {{ ticket.currentSolution?.solutionId }}（第 {{ ticket.currentSolution?.attemptNo }} 次，轮次 {{ ticket.roundId }}）提交决定。</p><p v-if="action === 'customer-confirm'">请先查看当前故障原因、解决方式和客户说明。确认后为已解决，仍需客服核验关闭；不是确认旧方案。</p><template v-else><label>未解决理由<el-input v-model="form.reason" type="textarea" :rows="4" aria-label="未解决理由"/></label><p>反馈后回到同轮处理中，原方案和决定保留，工程师继续处理并另交新方案。</p></template></template>
        <template v-if="action === 'close'"><p>仅对客户已确认的当前方案 {{ ticket.currentSolution?.solutionId }} 收尾，核验结果不替代提交时服务端重查。</p><el-button :disabled="work.busy.value" @click="loadCloseCheck">查询收尾核验</el-button><section v-if="closeCheck" class="notice close-check"><h4>当前版本收尾核验</h4><p>客户确认：{{ closeCheck.customerConfirmed ? '已确认' : '未确认' }} · 必要资料：{{ closeCheck.materialsComplete ? '完整' : '不完整' }}</p><p>适用范围：{{ closeCheck.scope === 'ORDINARY_REPAIR_ONLY' ? '普通维修' : '范围不支持，禁止关闭' }}</p><p>{{ relatedApprovalNotice(closeCheck) }}</p><p v-if="closeCheck.blockers.length">阻塞码：{{ closeCheck.blockers.join('、') }}</p><p>{{ checkAllowsClose(closeCheck,ticket) ? '当前可提交人工收尾确认，提交时仍重新核验。' : '当前不能关闭，请核对阻塞事实。' }}</p></section><label>客户可见收尾说明<el-input v-model="form.closeMessage" type="textarea" aria-label="客户可见收尾说明"/></label><label><input v-model="form.acknowledged" type="checkbox" :disabled="!checkAllowsClose(closeCheck,ticket)"/>确认已核对客户确认、必要资料及本批适用检查</label></template>
        <template v-if="action === 'records'"><label>处理记录正文<el-input v-model="form.body" type="textarea" :rows="5" aria-label="处理记录正文"/></label><label>单条工时（0～24小时）<el-input v-model="form.workHours" aria-label="单条工时"/></label><label>记录可见性<select v-model="form.visibility" aria-label="记录可见性"><option value="INTERNAL">内部记录（默认）</option><option value="CUSTOMER_VISIBLE">客户可见</option></select></label><template v-if="form.visibility === 'CUSTOMER_VISIBLE'"><el-button @click="preview = signature; confirmed = false">预览公开内容</el-button><section v-if="preview === signature" class="notice"><h4>客户将看到以下正文</h4><p style="white-space:pre-wrap">{{ form.body }}</p><p>工时仅员工可见，不向客户公开。</p><label><input v-model="confirmed" type="checkbox"/>确认将这段正文向客户公开</label></section></template><p>记录追加后不可编辑。本批不上传处理记录附件，也不提交解决或关闭。</p></template>
      </fieldset><div class="actions"><el-button native-type="submit" type="primary" :disabled="work.busy.value || fileBusy || !canWrite">{{ action === 'customer-confirm' ? '提交客户确认' : action === 'customer-return' ? '提交未解决反馈' : '确认' + actionLabels[action] }}</el-button><el-button :disabled="work.busy.value || fileBusy" @click="action = ''">返回详情</el-button></div></form>
      <details><summary>按保存的原UUID查询动作结果</summary><p>刷新后可查询历史结果。没有原参数时不提供重交，也不根据404新建动作。</p><form class="actions" @submit.prevent="lookup"><el-input v-model="lookupKey" aria-label="原动作UUID"/><el-button native-type="submit" :disabled="work.busy.value || !uuid(lookupKey)">查询已保存UUID</el-button></form></details>
    </template>
  </section>
</template>









<style scoped>
.ticket-actions :deep(.el-button){max-width:100%;height:auto;min-height:32px;white-space:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.ticket-actions :deep(input[type=file]){max-width:100%}
</style>
